UC23 ..> UC21 : <<extend>>
UC24 ..> UC21 : <<extend>>
UC28 ..> UC26 : <<extend>>
UC44 ..> UC26 : <<extend>>
UC30 ..> UC26 : <<extend>>
UC32 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC33 ..> UC32 : <<extend>>
UC34 ..> UC32 : <<extend>>
UC35 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC36 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC37 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC38 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC39 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC40 ..> UC31 : <<extend>>
UC49 ..> UC48 : <<extend>>

legend right
  Bege: feito
  Azul-claro <<planejado>>: planejado (11/2026)
  Cinza <<extra>>: extra, fora do beta
endlegend
@enduml
